{"synopsis":"대사형 선유, Master manhwa yang hebat Dari penulis Peerless dad Some\nchildren are raised in the hands of Kwak No, Setelah menjalin hubungan Murid-Guru,\nanak-anak memimpikan impian mereka sendiri dengan berlatih seni bela diri\ndan berjalan di jalan itu menuju menjadi master. Untuk mencari nafkah,\nKwak No selalu harus meninggalkan tempat duduknya, dan Seon-yu,\nanak tertua dari anak-anak, harus merawat Anak-anak, dan Dia akan menjadi Guru Besar.","alternative_title":"대사형 선유","author":"Noh Kyung-chan","artist":"Park Chang-hwan","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"13b7f219-3e6d-44e0-9854-b87f3e49238f","number":"144","chapter":"144","title":"","date":"2026-05-05","released":"2026-05-05"},{"chapter_id":"c065e955-3004-41d4-957b-46ebaf98a6c8","number":"143","chapter":"143","title":"","date":"2026-04-10","released":"2026-04-10"},{"chapter_id":"65db81bd-06ec-4b84-a0fa-c2fca2033d9a","number":"142","chapter":"142","title":"","date":"2026-04-10","released":"2026-04-10"},{"chapter_id":"5f0dc523-f023-457f-b4aa-5b904fce2d6b","number":"141","chapter":"141","title":"","date":"2026-04-10","released":"2026-04-10"},{"chapter_id":"1895c145-024f-4d01-ac77-83e36d15c48a","number":"140","chapter":"140","title":"","date":"2026-01-20","released":"2026-01-20"},{"chapter_id":"4b109077-926b-4cfc-9cd6-22108c723dde","number":"139","chapter":"139","title":".","date":"2026-01-17","released":"2026-01-17"},{"chapter_id":"ef528c13-1a1c-4daf-b3b0-cfca6cc6d284","number":"138","chapter":"138","title":"","date":"2026-01-17","released":"2026-01-17"},{"chapter_id":"2f1112ef-dcca-454e-99e5-c1e1da66319c","number":"137","chapter":"137","title":"","date":"2026-01-17","released":"2026-01-17"},{"chapter_id":"02fa62f1-d8b3-4d8d-bfc1-18fab65a9e76","number":"136","chapter":"136","title":"","date":"2026-01-17","released":"2026-01-17"},{"chapter_id":"a1670d17-11a6-4059-b229-a74894fe6181","number":"135","chapter":"135","title":"","date":"2026-01-17","released":"2026-01-17"},{"chapter_id":"bde38324-61b8-4ffd-be05-475bf